    - Key: nmc.scene.ground
      Value: '{"source":"export/HH-nmc-ground-part-1-2026-09-30/ground/NineMileCreekSeabed_HeightTex_plan.png
        (16-bit, -6 to +6 m; file sha256 a998ce68ca3a8e05179b54d7f1b4d5d95ecdb804fca921b75c20df86ddd56c75,
        pixels sha256 edce029b38697ebfb3b15eb64f9286f08b697e93c699cd83556eb69236819564),
        with its still water, through NmcHeightTex","ruled":"09-30, the owner on part
        1: \u201cGo with leans\u201d (STATE.md s4)","laid":[],"note":"The Falls lay
        nothing of their own: the texture carries the head of tide as a ramp (bed
        +2.55 to +0.1 over x -279 to -271, the still water +2.90 to +0.58), and the
        three steps stand on it as rock (the cascade piece) with their water painted
        over the texture\u2019s still water.","inTexture":{"grading":"fill.nmc_river_wall","reissue":"HH-nmc-ground-part-1-reissue-2026-10-01
        (pixels 00cf42cf\u2026), kept in HH-nmc-ground-part-1-reissue-2-2026-10-02","laid":[{"id":"wall.nmc_river_wall","ref":"keyscene.nmc_town_bridge","what":"the
        town bridge scene\u2019s river wall and fill; its west end (x -266 to -262)
        is in this scene\u2019s frame","rule":"as keyscene.nmc_town_bridge ground.laid"}]},"standsOn":"export/HH-nmc-ground-part-1-reissue-2-2026-10-02/
        (pixels b997bdce\u2026)","laidNote":"No scene lays ground of its own: the
        town bridge\u2019s river wall fill, which this scene drew as a ref is in the
        texture since the 10-01 re-issue (call 15), by the same rule. The boards stand
        as baked."}'
    - Key: nmc.scene.context
      Value: '{"river":"stream.nmc_town_river: the fresh reach above the Falls at
        +2.9, the pool below at +0.58 (still water above the tide until the flood
        tops it)","falls":"falls.nmc_the_falls (lip +2.55, foot +0.3, drop 2.25 m
        over 5.5 m)","paths":["path.nmc_falls_path (the lookout down to the Falls)","path.nmc_river_trail
        (the north bank, west)"],"boardwalks":["boardwalk.nmc_falls_deck","boardwalk.nmc_town_north
